    "role": "user",
    "content": "Program: CBTRN02C. Input files and their record layouts:\n\nDALYTRAN: CVTRA06Y DALYTRAN-RECORD (350 bytes)\n  DALYTRAN-ID                  X(16)\n  DALYTRAN-TYPE-CD             X(2)\n  DALYTRAN-CAT-CD              9(4)\n  DALYTRAN-SOURCE              X(10)\n  DALYTRAN-DESC                X(100)\n  DALYTRAN-AMT                 S9(9)V9(2)\n  DALYTRAN-MERCHANT-ID         9(9)\n  DALYTRAN-MERCHANT-NAME       X(50)\n  DALYTRAN-MERCHANT-CITY       X(50)\n  DALYTRAN-MERCHANT-ZIP        X(10)\n  DALYTRAN-CARD-NUM            X(16)\n  DALYTRAN-ORIG-TS             X(26)\n  DALYTRAN-PROC-TS             X(26)\n\nXREF: CVACT03Y CARD-XREF-RECORD (50 bytes)\n  XREF-CARD-NUM                X(16)\n  XREF-CUST-ID                 9(9)\n  XREF-ACCT-ID                 9(11)\n\nACCOUNT: CVACT01Y ACCOUNT-RECORD (300 bytes)\n  ACCT-ID                      9(11)\n  ACCT-ACTIVE-STATUS           X(1)\n  ACCT-CURR-BAL                S9(10)V9(2)\n  ACCT-CREDIT-LIMIT            S9(10)V9(2)\n  ACCT-CASH-CREDIT-LIMIT       S9(10)V9(2)\n  ACCT-OPEN-DATE               X(10)\n  ACCT-EXPIRAION-DATE          X(10)\n  ACCT-REISSUE-DATE            X(10)\n  ACCT-CURR-CYC-CREDIT         S9(10)V9(2)\n  ACCT-CURR-CYC-DEBIT          S9(10)V9(2)\n  ACCT-ADDR-ZIP                X(10)\n  ACCT-GROUP-ID                X(10)\n\nTCATBAL: CVTRA01Y TRAN-CAT-BAL-RECORD (50 bytes)\n  TRANCAT-ACCT-ID              9(11)\n  TRANCAT-TYPE-CD              X(2)\n  TRANCAT-CD                   9(4)\n  TRAN-CAT-BAL                 S9(9)V9(2)\n\nRule to test:\n{\n \"id\": \"BR-CBTRN02C-006\",\n \"title\": \"Posting updates or creates the transaction category balance record\",\n \"summary\": \"Each validated daily transaction is added to a category balance record keyed by account ID, transaction type code and category code. If no record exists for that key, a new one is created with the transaction amount as its balance. If one exists, the amount is added to its balance and the record is rewritten.\",\n \"given\": [\n  {\n   \"text\": \"The daily transaction passed validation (no failure reason was set), so it is posted.\",\n   \"fields\": [\n    \"WS-VALIDATION-FAIL-REASON\"\n   ],\n   \"literals\": []\n  },\n  {\n   \"text\": \"The category balance key is the account ID from the card cross-reference, plus the transaction's type code and category code.\",\n   \"fields\": [\n    \"XREF-ACCT-ID\",\n    \"FD-TRANCAT-ACCT-ID\",\n    \"DALYTRAN-TYPE-CD\",\n    \"FD-TRANCAT-TYPE-CD\",\n    \"DALYTRAN-CAT-CD\",\n    \"FD-TRANCAT-CD\"\n   ],\n   \"literals\": []\n  },\n  {\n   \"text\": \"The category balance is a signed amount with 9 integer digits and 2 decimal places.\",\n   \"fields\": [\n    \"TRAN-CAT-BAL\"\n   ],\n   \"literals\": []\n  }\n ],\n \"when\": [\n  {\n   \"text\": \"The program reads the category balance file by that key. If no record is found, it sets the create flag to Y; otherwise the flag stays N.\",\n   \"fields\": [\n    \"WS-CREATE-TRANCAT-REC\",\n    \"TCATBAL-FILE\",\n    \"TRAN-CAT-BAL-RECORD\"\n   ],\n   \"literals\": [\n    \"N\",\n    \"Y\"\n   ]\n  }\n ],\n \"then\": [\n  {\n   \"text\": \"If the create flag is Y, a new record is built. Otherwise the existing record is updated.\",\n   \"fields\": [\n    \"WS-CREATE-TRANCAT-REC\"\n   ],\n   \"literals\": [\n    \"Y\"\n   ]\n  },\n  {\n   \"text\": \"Create case: the record is initialized so the balance starts at zero.\",\n   \"fields\": [\n    \"TRAN-CAT-BAL-RECORD\"\n   ],\n   \"literals\": []\n  },\n  {\n   \"text\": \"Create case: the account ID, type code and category code are copied into the new record's key fields.\",\n   \"fields\": [\n    \"XREF-ACCT-ID\",\n    \"TRANCAT-ACCT-ID\",\n    \"DALYTRAN-TYPE-CD\",\n    \"TRANCAT-TYPE-CD\",\n    \"DALYTRAN-CAT-CD\",\n    \"TRANCAT-CD\"\n   ],\n   \"literals\": []\n  },\n  {\n   \"text\": \"Create case: the transaction amount, with its sign, is added to the zero balance and the new record is written to the category balance file.\",\n   \"fields\": [\n    \"DALYTRAN-AMT\",\n    \"TRAN-CAT-BAL\",\n    \"FD-TRAN-CAT-BAL-RECORD\"\n   ],\n   \"literals\": []\n  },\n  {\n   \"text\": \"Update case: the transaction amount, with its sign, is added to the existing balance and the record is rewritten in place.\",\n   \"fields\": [\n    \"DALYTRAN-AMT\",\n    \"TRAN-CAT-BAL\",\n    \"FD-TRAN-CAT-BAL-RECORD\"\n   ],\n   \"literals\": []\n  },\n  {\n   \"text\": \"Update case: the ADD to the balance has no ON SIZE ERROR clause. If the sum has more than 9 integer digits, the high-order digits are silently dropped.\",\n   \"fields\": [\n    \"DALYTRAN-AMT\",\n    \"TRAN-CAT-BAL\"\n   ],\n   \"literals\": []\n  }\n ]\n}"
   }
